# VHDL medián 3x3 (window_gen): vektory, xsim všech rozměrů/okrajů/poruch, obálka, regrese ostatních obálek, OOC, CSV
cd DP/vhdl/tb && bash gen_vectors.sh
cd DP/vhdl/scripts && for size in 0 1 2 3 4 5; do for rep in true false; do bash run_xsim.sh tb_median G_SIZE=$size G_REPLICATE=$rep G_VALID_PCT=70 G_READY_PCT=70 || exit 1; done; done
cd DP/vhdl/scripts && bash run_xsim.sh tb_median G_GARBAGE=7
cd DP/vhdl/scripts && bash run_xsim.sh tb_median G_BAD_EOL_ROW=5
cd DP/vhdl/scripts && bash run_xsim.sh tb_median G_SIZE=4 G_GARBAGE=3 G_BAD_EOL_ROW=2 G_VALID_PCT=40 G_READY_PCT=60
cd DP/vhdl/scripts && bash run_xsim.sh tb_median_axil G_REPLICATE=true && bash run_xsim.sh tb_median_axil G_REPLICATE=false
# regrese: registrová banka se změnila (status_ap_vld COR)
cd DP/vhdl/scripts && bash run_xsim.sh tb_csc_axil G_PRESET=1 && bash run_xsim.sh tb_hsv_axil G_RGB_TO_HSV=true G_TEST=0
cd DP/vhdl/scripts && vivado -mode batch -nojournal -nolog -source ooc_impl.tcl -tclargs median_core
cd DP/vhdl/scripts && vivado -mode batch -nojournal -nolog -source ooc_impl.tcl -tclargs median_axil
cd DP/vhdl/scripts && python3 collect_vhdl.py ../build/ooc ~/logs/vhdl_results.csv
